Package: arcgistiles
Title: Map Images, Tiles, and Basemaps from 'ArcGIS' Services
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Josiah", "Parry", , "josiah.parry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9910-865X"))
Description: Read map services, vector tile services, and the 'ArcGIS'
    basemap styles service. Export map images for a single extent or a
    series of extents, download raster and vector tiles for an area of
    interest, and assemble them into georeferenced rasters for plotting
    alongside vector data.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/JosiahParry/arcgistiles
BugReports: https://github.com/JosiahParry/arcgistiles/issues
